            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;moon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;moon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>result</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die beiden Strings <code>\"moon\"</code> sind identisch. Welchen Wert speichert <code>!==</code> in <code>result</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;moon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;moon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>result</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>moon</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
