            "id": 115156,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mainSubject = \" /><text value=\"43\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" extraCurricular = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = (mainSubject &gt; \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") &amp;&amp; (extraCurricular &gt; \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fehler</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>mainSubject &gt; 35</code> ist wahr, <code>extraCurricular &gt; 40</code> aber falsch. Was zeigt der Ausdruck mit <code>&amp;&amp;</code> an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mainSubject = \" /><text value=\"43\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" extraCurricular = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = (mainSubject &gt; \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") &amp;&amp; (extraCurricular &gt; \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fehler</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>43</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 6",
            "id": 115161,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überprüfe, ob der Code funktioniert oder nicht. Der Code funktioniert, wenn die Tests laufen <em>oder</em> die Ausgabe das gewünschte Ergebnis liefert.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testsRun = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" outputShows = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = testsRun || outputShows; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Code working? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Code working? : true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>testsRun</code>, gefolgt von <code>||</code> und schließlich <code>outputShows</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Code funktioniert, wenn Tests laufen oder die Ausgabe stimmt. Verknüpfe <code>testsRun</code> und <code>outputShows</code> mit OR.</p><p>Lass <code>testsRun</code> links und setze <code>outputShows</code> so, dass die Konsole <code>Code working? : true</code> anzeigt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testsRun = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" outputShows = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = testsRun || outputShows; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Code working? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Code working? : true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>true</code>, gefolgt von <code>testsRun</code>, <code>||</code> und schließlich <code>outputShows</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
